References: <xq7rWPcyO9U.fjvbi5ISBwAJ@brms-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/brms-users/c/xq7rWPcyO9U/m/vQcxWKo0BwAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

You are right, this is not yet possible in brms, but it sounds like a useful feature.

Would you mind opening an issue on github (https://github.com/paul-buerkner/brms), so that I don't loose track of it?

Best,
Paul

